{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209021614effa5bf8c41e48e1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis, I'll create a **Ruby Noir & Antique Silver** aesthetic - a warm, luxurious palette with deep ruby reds, antique silver accents, and cream porcelain backgrounds. This direction hasn't been used before and will feature **gemstone faceted border-radius shapes** for a crystalline, elegant effect. The typography will be **Crimson Pro (display) + Space Grotesk (body)**.\n\nLet me create the folder and build the website:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"771d6dab-a6df-4f09-97b2-4d43c0cdb268","uuid":"35c7fcce-dff8-4684-a0dc-bb5435706e53"}
