{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_ab1e16aef1e44e7085ecd85a","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Ralph Progress Log\n     2→\n     3→This file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\n     4→after each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n     5→\n     6→## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n     7→\n     8→*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n     9→\n    10→- **Ivory & Emerald Noir Palette**: `--color-emerald: #2D5A4A`, `--color-emerald-light: #3D7A6A`, `--color-emerald-mid: #4A8A7A`, `--color-emerald-dark: #1D3A2A`, `--color-emerald-deep: #0D2A1A`, `--color-emerald-mist: #E8F0EC`, `--color-ivory: #FAFAF6`, `--color-ivory-warm: #F5F5F0`, `--color-sage: #8BA89A`, `--color-gold: #B89B5A` - natural, sophisticated aesthetic with organic qualities inspired by leaves and nature\n    11→- **Leaf Border Radius**: `--radius-leaf-1: 65% 35% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%`, `--radius-leaf-2: 45% 55% 65% 35% / 45% 55% 45% 55%`, `--radius-leaf-3: 55% 45% 35% 65% / 55% 45% 55% 45%`, `--radius-leaf-4: 35% 65% 55% 45% / 45% 55% 45% 55%` for organic, leaf-shaped animations that feel natural and alive\n    12→- **Libre Baskerville + Outfit Typography**: Classic serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance with excellent readability\n    13→\n    14→---\n    15→\n    16→## 2025-02-08 - US-071\n    17→- Created complete website for Dra Juliana Bittencourt - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    18→- Files changed:\n    19→  - `site-demo/dra-juliana-bittencourt-harmonizacao-facial/index.html` (new)\n    20→- **Design Concept**: Ivory & Emerald Noir aesthetic with deep emerald greens, warm gold accents, and ivory backgrounds. A completely new natural/organic direction from previous palettes (amethyst/platinum, orchid/brass, sapphire/champagne, rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, amber/bronze, etc.). Leaf-shaped border-radius patterns create organic, natural animations reminiscent of falling leaves and nature.\n    21→- **Typography**: Libre Baskerville (display) paired with Outfit (body) for classic elegance with modern geometric readability\n    22→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    23→  - Animated hero with 4 floating leaf-shaped backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    24→  - Leaf border-radius patterns (`--radius-leaf-1`, `--radius-leaf-2`, `--radius-leaf-3`, `--radius-leaf-4`) create organic, natural animations\n    25→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    26→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n    27→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    28→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars on emerald-soft background\n    29→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n    30→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    31→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    32→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    33→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    34→- **Contact Info**: R. Triunfo, 1349 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-612 | (16) 99725-2010\n    35→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-juliana-bittencourt-harmonizacao-facial\n    36→- **Verification**:\n    37→  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n    38→  - Mobile view (375x812) responsive: ✓\n    39→  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n    40→  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n    41→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    42→\n    43→**Learnings:**\n    44→- **Pattern**: Ivory & Emerald Noir palette creates a natural, sophisticated aesthetic with organic qualities that conveys freshness and natural beauty - completely different from all previous palettes\n    45→- **Pattern**: Leaf border-radius shapes (`65% 35% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%`) provide a more organic, flowing interpretation of blobmorphism that feels natural and alive\n    46→- **Pattern**: Libre Baskerville + Outfit typography pairing combines classic serif elegance with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated readability\n    47→- **Gotcha**: The emerald-ivory-gold palette feels more natural and contemporary while maintaining premium positioning - it evokes feelings of freshness, nature, and organic beauty\n    48→- **Gotcha**: Leaf-shaped borders create a distinctive organic aesthetic with flowing movements that feel alive and dynamic - different from all previous shape patterns used\n    49→- **Gotcha**: Ivory backgrounds (#FAFAF6) provide warm clean foundation that pairs beautifully with emerald greens, creating a fresh, natural atmosphere\n    50→- **Gotcha**: The emerald palette differentiates significantly from both cool (amethyst, sapphire) and warm (orchid, amber) palettes of previous sites while maintaining the premium aesthetic expected by aesthetic clinic clients\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"771d6dab-a6df-4f09-97b2-4d43c0cdb268","uuid":"14caa132-28b8-4d21-bb7f-ddd97a5a09c5","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/.ralph-tui/progress.md","content":"# Ralph Progress Log\n\nThis file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\nafter each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n\n## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n\n*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n\n- **Ivory & Emerald Noir Palette**: `--color-emerald: #2D5A4A`, `--color-emerald-light: #3D7A6A`, `--color-emerald-mid: #4A8A7A`, `--color-emerald-dark: #1D3A2A`, `--color-emerald-deep: #0D2A1A`, `--color-emerald-mist: #E8F0EC`, `--color-ivory: #FAFAF6`, `--color-ivory-warm: #F5F5F0`, `--color-sage: #8BA89A`, `--color-gold: #B89B5A` - natural, sophisticated aesthetic with organic qualities inspired by leaves and nature\n- **Leaf Border Radius**: `--radius-leaf-1: 65% 35% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%`, `--radius-leaf-2: 45% 55% 65% 35% / 45% 55% 45% 55%`, `--radius-leaf-3: 55% 45% 35% 65% / 55% 45% 55% 45%`, `--radius-leaf-4: 35% 65% 55% 45% / 45% 55% 45% 55%` for organic, leaf-shaped animations that feel natural and alive\n- **Libre Baskerville + Outfit Typography**: Classic serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance with excellent readability\n\n---\n\n## 2025-02-08 - US-071\n- Created complete website for Dra Juliana Bittencourt - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n- Files changed:\n  - `site-demo/dra-juliana-bittencourt-harmonizacao-facial/index.html` (new)\n- **Design Concept**: Ivory & Emerald Noir aesthetic with deep emerald greens, warm gold accents, and ivory backgrounds. A completely new natural/organic direction from previous palettes (amethyst/platinum, orchid/brass, sapphire/champagne, rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, amber/bronze, etc.). Leaf-shaped border-radius patterns create organic, natural animations reminiscent of falling leaves and nature.\n- **Typography**: Libre Baskerville (display) paired with Outfit (body) for classic elegance with modern geometric readability\n- **Key Features Implemented**:\n  - Animated hero with 4 floating leaf-shaped backgrounds using gradient meshes\n  - Leaf border-radius patterns (`--radius-leaf-1`, `--radius-leaf-2`, `--radius-leaf-3`, `--radius-leaf-4`) create organic, natural animations\n  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars on emerald-soft background\n  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n- **Contact Info**: R. Triunfo, 1349 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-612 | (16) 99725-2010\n- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-juliana-bittencourt-harmonizacao-facial\n- **Verification**:\n  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n  - Mobile view (375x812) responsive: ✓\n  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n\n**Learnings:**\n- **Pattern**: Ivory & Emerald Noir palette creates a natural, sophisticated aesthetic with organic qualities that conveys freshness and natural beauty - completely different from all previous palettes\n- **Pattern**: Leaf border-radius shapes (`65% 35% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%`) provide a more organic, flowing interpretation of blobmorphism that feels natural and alive\n- **Pattern**: Libre Baskerville + Outfit typography pairing combines classic serif elegance with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated readability\n- **Gotcha**: The emerald-ivory-gold palette feels more natural and contemporary while maintaining premium positioning - it evokes feelings of freshness, nature, and organic beauty\n- **Gotcha**: Leaf-shaped borders create a distinctive organic aesthetic with flowing movements that feel alive and dynamic - different from all previous shape patterns used\n- **Gotcha**: Ivory backgrounds (#FAFAF6) provide warm clean foundation that pairs beautifully with emerald greens, creating a fresh, natural atmosphere\n- **Gotcha**: The emerald palette differentiates significantly from both cool (amethyst, sapphire) and warm (orchid, amber) palettes of previous sites while maintaining the premium aesthetic expected by aesthetic clinic clients","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1065}}}
