{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026020902195660a1336033e84ae8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"US-072 has been completed successfully. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## US-072 - Dra. Miriam Freitas Estética Facial e Corporal - ✅ COMPLETE\n\n### What Was Implemented\n\n**Design Concept**: Ruby Noir & Antique Silver aesthetic - a warm, luxurious palette with deep ruby reds (`#B83A5A`), antique silver accents (`#B8B8C0`), and porcelain backgrounds (`#FAFAF8`). This is a completely new direction from all previous palettes (emerald, amethyst, sapphire, lavender, sage, amber, plum, burgundy, etc.).\n\n**Typography**: Crimson Pro (display) + Space Grotesk (body) - elegant serif warmth with modern geometric readability.\n\n**Unique Design Elements**:\n- **Gemstone Faceted Border Radius**: 4 faceted patterns (`55% 45% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%`) creating crystalline, angular shapes reminiscent of precious gemstones\n- 4 floating gemstone backgrounds with gradient meshes and rotation animations\n- Ruby-to-silver gradient transitions\n- Testimonials on deep ruby background with gradient avatars\n\n### Files Changed\n- `site-demo/dra-miriam-freitas-estetica-facial-e-corporal/index.html` (new, 56 KB)\n\n### Key Features\n- Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n- Hero section with animated gemstone backgrounds\n- Problem/Solution section with left border accents\n- 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Corporais)\n- 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n- 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n- Contact form with WhatsApp integration\n- Fully responsive for mobile, tablet, desktop\n- Intersection Observer animations\n- Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles\n\n### Contact Information\n- **Address**: R. Magda Perona Frossard, 770 - Sala 10 - Nova Aliança, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14026-596, Brazil\n- **Phone**: (16) 99205-3308\n- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-miriam-freitas-estetica-facial-e-corporal\n\n### Verification\n- ✅ Desktop view verified\n- ✅ Mobile view (375x812) responsive\n- ✅ Form submission to WhatsApp\n- ✅ Smooth scroll navigation\n- ✅ All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer\n\n### Learnings\n- Ruby Noir & Antique Silver palette creates a warm, luxurious aesthetic that evokes feelings of elegance, luxury, and timeless beauty\n- Gemstone faceted border-radius shapes provide a distinctive crystalline aesthetic with angular movements that differentiate from all previous organic patterns\n- Crimson Pro + Space Grotesk typography pairing offers elegant warmth with modern geometric readability<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"771d6dab-a6df-4f09-97b2-4d43c0cdb268","uuid":"a3402ef0-d729-48b9-aac5-5a04c30fbde9"}
